<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Suropati Park Guide" description="Privacy policy for the independent Suropati Park Guide." lang="en">
  <header class="site-header policy-header"><Logo href="/en/" /><a class="header-cta" href="/en/">← Back to guide</a></header>
  <main class="policy-page"><section class="policy-hero"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--clay">SITE DOCUMENT · 01</p><h1>Privacy<br /><em>Policy</em></h1><p>Last updated: August 2026</p></section><section class="policy-content"><aside><p class="eyebrow">ON THIS PAGE</p><a href="#data">Information collected</a><a href="#use">How it is used</a><a href="#third-party">Third parties</a><a href="#rights">Your choices</a></aside><article><div id="data"><p class="eyebrow">01</p><h2>Information collected</h2><p>We collect the minimum data needed to run and improve this site. This may include technical browsing information, cookies or similar technology, and information you voluntarily provide through a contact channel.</p></div><div id="use"><p class="eyebrow">02</p><h2>How it is used</h2><p>Data is used to improve content and experience, understand aggregate use, respond to requests, and meet applicable legal obligations. We do not sell personal information.</p></div><div id="third-party"><p class="eyebrow">03</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Google Maps provides the embedded map. Google Analytics can be loaded only after consent. Each provider maintains its own policy; their use is limited by the choices and services described here.</p></div><div id="rights"><p class="eyebrow">04</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Subject to applicable law, you may request access, correction, deletion, or object to processing. You can change this site’s analytics choice at any time from the cookie settings page.</p><a class="button button--solid" href="/en/cookies">Open cookie settings <span>→</span></a></div></article></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
